# ============================================================================
# TEB-Net research repository
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What is intentionally NOT tracked here, and where to get it:
#   * .venv/                     -> recreate: python -m venv .venv && pip install -e .
#   * *.ckpt / *.pt / *.npz      -> ~2.5 GB of model weights. Full snapshot of
#                                   the research tree is in
#                                   tebnet_research_2026-10-19.zip (2.3 GB).
#   * third-party SOTA clones    -> models-baseline/sota/{chemprop_repo,
#                                   DeepTherm,HC-Thermochemistry,RMG-database}
#                                   are separate upstream repos. Our local
#                                   modifications to them are preserved in
#                                   models-baseline/sota_patches/.
# ============================================================================

# --- Python environment -----------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.conda/
python_env.yaml
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# --- Python bytecode / caches ----------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# --- Model weights & large binary artefacts ---------------------------------
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
*.joblib

# --- Data caches ------------------------------------------------------------
.descriptor_cache/
.chemistry_cache/

# --- Nested upstream git repositories ---------------------------------------
# These are independent clones; see models-baseline/sota_patches/ for our diff.
models-baseline/sota/chemprop_repo/
models-baseline/sota/DeepTherm/
models-baseline/sota/HC-Thermochemistry/
models/tebnet-v3/RMG-database/

# --- Editor / OS noise ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Agent tooling (was quarantined 2026-10-19) -----------------------------
.claude/
.roo/
.augment/
.qwen/
.windsurf/
.trae/
.tabnine/
.agents/
skills/
skills-lock.json

# --- Runtime outputs --------------------------------------------------------
*.log
# TensorBoard event files are runtime logs, not results (results.json holds the
# numbers). They are also rewritten while a run is in progress, which would
# leave the tree permanently dirty.
*.tfevents.*
events.out.tfevents.*
**/RUNNING.lock

# --- Large reproducibility sweeps ------------------------------------------
# The five-split ensemble of Section 3.3 is regenerated by
# models/tebnet-v3/check/run_divergence_sweep.sh (~80 MB of run directories per
# split). Only the per-species predictions (check/sweep_predictions/) are
# tracked, because every table in the paper is built from them.
models/tebnet-v3/benchmark_results_deeptherm/*_splitH/random[1-9]/
models/tebnet-v3/benchmark_results_deeptherm/*_splitSCp/random[1-9]/
# exploratory runs that no table depends on
models/tebnet-v3/confirm_small/

# --- Third-party papers (copyright) ----------------------------------------
DeepTherm.pdf

# --- LaTeX build artefacts --------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.out
*.spl
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
si_compile_test.pdf
teb_manuscript/teb_manuscript_revised.zip


# manuscript sources and internal analysis (not part of the public code)
tebnet_manuscript/
dataset-analysis/

# private figure materials (never publish)
figures_materials/
archive/